# Kyren Legate's Mode$ AlternativeCost static carries CheckSVar$ X (an
# opponent controls a Plains) and CheckSecondSVar$ Y (you control a
# Mountain): StaticAbility.checkConditions ANDs the chain
# (StaticAbility.java:462-512), so with both true option 1 casts it for
# Cost$ 0 and the untapped Mountain stays untapped.
startturn human
advance 3
queue option 1
castspell human 1
resolvestack
